abstract: >-
  BHAIRAV ENGINE (B-ENGINE) is an evidence-aware, human-centered,
  iterative bio-design and innovation methodology for healthcare,
  medical technology, digital health, diagnostics, public health,
  biomedical engineering, and related innovation domains. It provides
  a structured approach for moving from a stimulus, need, problem,
  idea, dataset, technical concept, or desired end product toward
  structured, testable, evidence-supported, and implementable solutions.

